{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Jade Ring is a ",["l","戒指","ring"]," that can be purchased from the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," for 2,500g after completing the ",["l","任务","Deeper in the Mine"]," Quest. It can also be found in ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing level 2"],". It can also be found in ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es."]],["p",["The Jade Ring increases ",["l","暴击力量","critical strike power"]," by 10% while equipped."]],["p",["Equipping a second Jade Ring adds a further 10% critical strike power, for a total 20% increase."]]]],["Dyeing",2,[["p",["It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a green dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]]]}